    <string name="storage_test_message">Writes %1$s of test data, then reads it all back and verifies it.\n\n• Existing data is not erased (written to this app\'s own folder and deleted afterwards)\n• To reliably detect capacity faking, run with \"All free space\"\n• If stopped, only the data written so far is verified</string>
